SUMMARY:Study Day 3: SQL Aggregation & Grouping
DESCRIPTION:Cover GROUP BY, HAVING, aggregate functions, and date functions. Solve 2 practice questions.\n\nTopics:\n- GROUP BY clause\n- HAVING clause for filtering groups\n- Aggregate functions: SUM, AVG, COUNT, MIN, MAX\n- Date functions: DATE_TRUNC, EXTRACT, DATE_PART\n- Combining aggregation with joins\n\nPractice Problems:\n1. Monthly Revenue\n2. Top 5 Customers by Revenue\n\nResources:\n- SQLBolt GROUP BY\n- Mode Analytics Aggregation\n- W3Schools SQL GROUP BY
